@doc email_chain
@meta title: Email chain on a service complaint
@meta subject: RE: Service complaint - follow up required
@meta traps: a quoted reply has a different author; a signature inside a quote belongs to the quoted sender
@cast coordinator=official manager=official requester=requester witness=third_party director=official
@block email_header
From: {coordinator.full_name} <{coordinator.work_email}>
Sent: Thursday, 18 June, 4:12 PM
To: {manager.full_name} <{manager.work_email}>
Cc: {director.full_name} <{director.work_email}>
Subject: RE: Service complaint - follow up required

@block body
Thanks. I have added the note to the file and told the client we will write this week.

For the record, the client is {requester.full_name}, file {requester.file_number}, and
the best number is {requester.personal_phone}. The client has asked that we not call
before 10 AM.

The other individual mentioned in the complaint is {witness.full_name}, who was in the
waiting area and has since written to us separately from {witness.personal_email}. I do
not think we need anything further from {witness.given_name} at this stage.

@block signature
{coordinator.full_name}
{coordinator.title}
{coordinator.organisation}
{coordinator.work_phone}

@block email_header
From: {manager.full_name} <{manager.work_email}>
Sent: Thursday, 18 June, 2:45 PM
To: {coordinator.full_name} <{coordinator.work_email}>
Subject: Service complaint - follow up required

@block body
Can you confirm whether the client has been contacted? {director.given_name} asked at
the operations meeting this morning and I did not have an answer.

If it helps, the original complaint came in through the online form on 2 June and the
acknowledgement went out the same day.

@block signature
{manager.full_name}
{manager.title}
{manager.work_phone}

@block email_header
From: {witness.full_name} <{witness.personal_email}>
Sent: Wednesday, 17 June, 9:03 AM
To: {coordinator.full_name} <{coordinator.work_email}>
Subject: What I saw on 2 June

@block body
I was waiting for my own appointment and I saw what happened. I live at
{witness.home_address} and you can reach me on {witness.personal_phone} if you need a
statement. I would rather my name was not given to the other person involved.
